<div class="blockquote">
<p><em>&quot;There are very deep and restrictive principles that determine the nature of human language and that are rooted in the specific character of the human mind.&quot;</em><br /></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><em>~Noam Chomsky</em></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="blockquote">
<p><em>&quot;Give orange me give eat orange me eat orange give me eat orange give me you.&quot;</em><br /></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><em>~Nim Chimpsky</em></p>
</div>
</div>
<p>Believe it or not, this was initially inspired by a random word generator's prompt: &quot;Page radiation chimpanzee bald lease.&quot; It's probably the most fun I've had writing an SCP, and I hope you all enjoy it.</p>
<p>I'd like to give a shout-out to the lovely people who looked through this &#8212; <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1596660293" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;">stormbreath</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1596660293" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;">Pedagon</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4665703); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4665703&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1596660293" alt="Nagiros" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4665703)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4665703); return false;">Nagiros</a></span></p>

